{"data":{"title":"4nia","slug":"4nia","path":"/artists/afta-1/tracks/4nia/","artwork":"images/artists/afta-1/tracks/4nia.png","artist":{"id":"wCa2h-bWSGY","slug":"afta-1","links":null,"title":"Afta-1","artwork":null},"id":"0aH0MuJ9f2Q"},"appearanceCount":7,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"WosJ8Jq4YoI","show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"1QkZfWwfO_Q","show":{"id":"XktDRqtFx5o","slug":"202","title":"Soulection Radio Show #202 w/ AbJo, StarRo, & Andre Power (4th Anniversary Edition)","artwork":"/images/episodes/202.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2015-01-24T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"PzFhkpV7Js0","show":{"id":"8fbMb_M2jAg","slug":"240","title":"Soulection Radio Show #240 (Soulection Family New Year's Special)","artwork":"/images/episodes/240.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2016-01-01T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"hulhXaPjRNA","show":{"id":"ja5IOjwtCZg","slug":"287","title":"Soulection Radio Show #287 w/ Hannah Faith","artwork":"/images/episodes/287.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2016-11-26T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"fSoKj6o_d4A","show":{"id":"PhO0UJBiWkc","slug":"294","title":"Soulection Radio Show #29